{
    "background_story": "The Jream was a legendary spaceship that had been on countless missions across the galaxy. After a particularly grueling battle with space pirates, the Jream limped back to its home base in dire need of repair. The ship's captain, a seasoned veteran, decided it was time for a major refit. The Jream was stripped down to its core, and a team of expert engineers set to work upgrading its systems and armor. New engines were installed, and the ship's hull was reinforced with state-of-the-art materials. The Jream's refit took months to complete, but when it finally emerged from the dry dock, it was a virtually new ship. Its sleek, refurbished design and advanced technology made it the envy of the galaxy, and the Jream was ready to take on its next adventure.",
